{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludaro: Trials of the Eternal Board\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice are in motion. The board is shifting. Every choice, every roll, every twist brings you closer to victory or disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Every roll is an opportunity, but will you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00\u00a0Stack game-changing powers, defy the odds, and rewrite the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00\u00a0The board is alive, and it won\u2019t go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00\u00a0Wishlist now and prepare for the trials ahead!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>250+ Unique and Mind blowing Spirit Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.poster.avif?t=1771148281\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.webm?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/767fa8f742d9a17ae128090499476815.mp4?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Spirit Cards: Where Power is Born</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each passing round, you\u2019ll collect Spirit Cards - artifacts of pure chaos and strategy that reshape the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Double, triple, or even square your best rolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Alter the board, creating pathways to untold riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Summon mysterious creatures that grant unexpected bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Stack passive effects until reality bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same. No two players will ever take the same path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pawns have special abilities and there are tons of them\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.poster.avif?t=1771148281\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.webm?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/3102e18ca1934e79ccfae1bb70b0b7e2.mp4?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Roll the Dice, Play Your Way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling the dice isn\u2019t just about luck, it\u2019s about timing, planning, and taking the right risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You always know what\u2019s still possible but never what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play it safe, or push your luck for massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Every roll is a moment of strategy, will you take control, or embrace the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right move at the right time can change everything. Will you take the risk?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use a variety of Weapons and Modifiers to challenge the board</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/be572ac7d9185d3738135bcba1c719ff.poster.avif?t=1771148281\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/be572ac7d9185d3738135bcba1c719ff.webm?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/be572ac7d9185d3738135bcba1c719ff.mp4?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 The Rules Keep Changing\u2026 Can You Keep Up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every so often, a new challenge strikes, forcing you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Certain rolls become unusable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Your gains get slashed in half.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 The board transforms beneath your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you outmaneuver the chaos, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your Spirit Cards be enough to defy the board itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Exciting Packs for the surprises</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.poster.avif?t=1771148281\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.webm?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/4fff8893b4a31b55166c05d9fd049f88.mp4?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack Powers, Build Your Own Luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll unlock wild and unpredictable upgrades that push every run to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Spirit Cards that change the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Abilities that make every roll stronger, riskier, or more rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Creatures that reshape the board and unlock hidden opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Effects that combine, stack, and lead to explosive turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you craft a strategy built for success, or embrace the chaos and see where the dice take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand Crafted Fun Unique Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.poster.avif?t=1771148281\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.webm?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/extras/5a9f16488fb7fefa28ad732495db2f9d.mp4?t=1771148281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 A Tactical Dice System \u2013 Rolling isn\u2019t just luck it\u2019s about timing, risk, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Ever-Changing Challenges \u2013 The board, the rules, and the game itself shift as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Stackable Power-Ups \u2013 Spirit Cards combine in wild and unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Challenging Boss Rounds \u2013 Survive game-altering twists that force you to rethink your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 High-Risk, High-Reward Gameplay \u2013 Fortune favors the bold. How far will you push your luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>Ludaro is more fun with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get tips, discuss cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf81 Unlock exclusive rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd17 Join us on Discord\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST LUDARO TO BEGIN THE EPIC JOURNEY</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613030?t=1771148281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/95d2ae13d01dc097719c4b15fdedbbfb40430173/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771148281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/3fad26fcbbd61c49a6564ab287e9dce134d0ed89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771148281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613030/3fad26fcbbd61c49a6564ab287e9dce134d0ed89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771148281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3714910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ludaro: Trials of the Eternal Board\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dice are in motion. The board is shifting. Every choice, every roll, every twist brings you closer to victory or disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 Every roll is an opportunity, but will you take it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00\u00a0Stack game-changing powers, defy the odds, and rewrite the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00\u00a0The